{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-post-template-tsx","path":"/html-web-standards-guide/","result":{"data":{"site":{"siteMetadata":{"title":"Forest_LIM","author":"LIM","siteUrl":"https://logic-phantom.github.io"}},"allMarkdownRemark":{"edges":[{"node":{"html":"<h1>HTML에서 지켜야 할 웹표준 사항 총정리</h1>\n<blockquote>\n<p>**웹표준(Web Standards)**은 웹 개발자가 반드시 알아야 할 기본 중의 기본입니다.<br>\nHTML 문법을 정확히 지키는 것은 단순히 ‘규칙 준수’가 아니라,<br>\n접근성(Accessibility), 검색엔진최적화(SEO), 유지보수성, 호환성 모두를 지키는 핵심입니다.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2>1️⃣ 웹표준(Web Standards)이란?</h2>\n<h3>▪ 정의</h3>\n<p><strong>웹표준</strong>이란 W3C(World Wide Web Consortium)에서 정의한<br>\n웹 기술(HTML, CSS, JavaScript 등)의 **기술적 명세서(Specification)**를 의미합니다.</p>\n<p>즉, <strong>모든 브라우저에서 동일하게 동작하는 웹페이지</strong>를 만들기 위한 약속입니다.</p>\n<h3>▪ 핵심 목표</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>브라우저 간 호환성</strong> 확보</li>\n<li><strong>웹 접근성</strong> 향상 (장애인, 노약자 등 누구나 접근 가능하도록)</li>\n<li><strong>검색엔진 최적화(SEO)</strong> 개선</li>\n<li><strong>유지보수성</strong> 향상 및 코드 일관성 확보</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2>2️⃣ HTML에서 반드시 지켜야 할 기본 웹표준 사항</h2>\n<h3>1. 문서 구조 명시 (<code class=\"language-text\">&lt;!DOCTYPE html></code>)</h3>\n<p>모든 HTML 문서는 HTML5 문서형 선언으로 시작해야 합니다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"html\"><pre class=\"language-html\"><code class=\"language-html\"><span class=\"token doctype\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;!</span><span class=\"token doctype-tag\">DOCTYPE</span> <span class=\"token name\">html</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;</span>html</span> <span class=\"token attr-name\">lang</span><span class=\"token attr-value\"><span class=\"token punctuation attr-equals\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span>ko<span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;</span>head</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span>\n  <span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;</span>meta</span> <span class=\"token attr-name\">charset</span><span class=\"token attr-value\"><span class=\"token punctuation attr-equals\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span>UTF-8<span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span>\n  <span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;</span>title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span>웹표준 예제<span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;/</span>title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;/</span>head</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;</span>body</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;/</span>body</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;/</span>html</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span></code></pre></div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>💡 문서형 선언은 브라우저가 문법을 **표준 모드(Standard Mode)**로 해석하게 하는 핵심입니다.<br>\n누락 시 **호환 모드(Quirks Mode)**로 렌더링되어 CSS나 레이아웃이 달라질 수 있습니다.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h3>2. 시맨틱(Semantic) 태그 사용</h3>\n<p>HTML5에서는 단순한 레이아웃 목적의 <code class=\"language-text\">&lt;div></code> 대신 <strong>의미 있는 태그</strong>를 사용해야 합니다.</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>목적</th>\n<th>태그</th>\n<th>설명</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>문서 전체</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-text\">&lt;html></code>, <code class=\"language-text\">&lt;head></code>, <code class=\"language-text\">&lt;body></code></td>\n<td>문서 기본 구조</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>제목/본문</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-text\">&lt;header></code>, <code class=\"language-text\">&lt;section></code>, <code class=\"language-text\">&lt;article></code>, <code class=\"language-text\">&lt;footer></code></td>\n<td>문서의 의미 단위 구분</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>내비게이션</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-text\">&lt;nav></code></td>\n<td>메뉴, 링크 모음</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>강조</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-text\">&lt;strong></code>, <code class=\"language-text\">&lt;em></code></td>\n<td>텍스트의 의미 강조</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>목록</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-text\">&lt;ul></code>, <code class=\"language-text\">&lt;ol></code>, <code class=\"language-text\">&lt;li></code></td>\n<td>구조적 목록 표현</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<blockquote>\n<p>🧭 <strong>시맨틱 마크업</strong>은 스크린리더(시각장애인용 프로그램), 검색엔진이 콘텐츠 의미를 올바르게 해석하도록 돕습니다.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h3>3. 대체 텍스트(alt) 제공</h3>\n<p>이미지 태그에는 반드시 <code class=\"language-text\">alt</code> 속성을 추가해야 합니다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"html\"><pre class=\"language-html\"><code class=\"language-html\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;</span>img</span> <span class=\"token attr-name\">src</span><span class=\"token attr-value\"><span class=\"token punctuation attr-equals\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span>logo.png<span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span></span> <span class=\"token attr-name\">alt</span><span class=\"token attr-value\"><span class=\"token punctuation attr-equals\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span>회사 로고<span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span></code></pre></div>\n<ul>\n<li>시각장애인을 위한 스크린리더 지원</li>\n<li>이미지 로딩 실패 시 대체 텍스트 표시</li>\n<li>SEO(검색엔진) 인식 개선</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h3>4. 문법 오류 없는 구조</h3>\n<p>HTML 태그는 <strong>열린 태그는 닫혀야 하며</strong>, 중첩 관계가 올바르게 작성되어야 합니다.</p>\n<p>❌ 잘못된 예:</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"html\"><pre class=\"language-html\"><code class=\"language-html\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;</span>p</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;</span>strong</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span>텍스트<span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;</span>p</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;/</span>strong</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span></code></pre></div>\n<p>✅ 올바른 예:</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"html\"><pre class=\"language-html\"><code class=\"language-html\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;</span>p</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;</span>strong</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span>텍스트<span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;/</span>strong</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;/</span>p</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span></code></pre></div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>⚠️ HTML Validator(W3C Markup Validation Service)로 정기적인 검사 권장<br>\n👉 <a href=\"https://validator.w3.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://validator.w3.org/</a></p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h3>5. 접근성(Accessibility) 속성 준수</h3>\n<h4>ARIA 속성 사용 예시</h4>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"html\"><pre class=\"language-html\"><code class=\"language-html\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;</span>button</span> <span class=\"token attr-name\">aria-label</span><span class=\"token attr-value\"><span class=\"token punctuation attr-equals\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span>검색 버튼<span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span>🔍<span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;/</span>button</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span></code></pre></div>\n<ul>\n<li><code class=\"language-text\">aria-label</code> : 시각적 텍스트가 없는 요소에 의미 부여</li>\n<li><code class=\"language-text\">role</code>, <code class=\"language-text\">aria-hidden</code>, <code class=\"language-text\">aria-expanded</code> 등은 스크린리더용 인터페이스를 명확하게 전달</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>키보드 포커스 이동 고려</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><code class=\"language-text\">tabindex</code>로 포커스 순서 제어</li>\n<li><code class=\"language-text\">&lt;a></code> 또는 <code class=\"language-text\">&lt;button></code> 요소로 인터랙션 구성</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h3>6. 메타데이터 명시</h3>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"html\"><pre class=\"language-html\"><code class=\"language-html\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;</span>meta</span> <span class=\"token attr-name\">charset</span><span class=\"token attr-value\"><span class=\"token punctuation attr-equals\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span>UTF-8<span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;</span>meta</span> <span class=\"token attr-name\">name</span><span class=\"token attr-value\"><span class=\"token punctuation attr-equals\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span>viewport<span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span></span> <span class=\"token attr-name\">content</span><span class=\"token attr-value\"><span class=\"token punctuation attr-equals\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span>width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0<span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;</span>meta</span> <span class=\"token attr-name\">name</span><span class=\"token attr-value\"><span class=\"token punctuation attr-equals\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span>description<span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span></span> <span class=\"token attr-name\">content</span><span class=\"token attr-value\"><span class=\"token punctuation attr-equals\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span>웹표준 준수를 위한 HTML 가이드<span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span></code></pre></div>\n<ul>\n<li>모바일 반응형 페이지를 위해 <code class=\"language-text\">viewport</code> 필수</li>\n<li><code class=\"language-text\">description</code>은 검색결과 미리보기(SEO)에 사용됨</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h3>7. 외부 자원 로딩 시 표준 준수</h3>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"html\"><pre class=\"language-html\"><code class=\"language-html\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;</span>link</span> <span class=\"token attr-name\">rel</span><span class=\"token attr-value\"><span class=\"token punctuation attr-equals\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span>stylesheet<span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span></span> <span class=\"token attr-name\">href</span><span class=\"token attr-value\"><span class=\"token punctuation attr-equals\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span>style.css<span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;</span>script</span> <span class=\"token attr-name\">src</span><span class=\"token attr-value\"><span class=\"token punctuation attr-equals\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span>main.js<span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span></span> <span class=\"token attr-name\">defer</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span><span class=\"token script\"></span><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;/</span>script</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span></code></pre></div>\n<ul>\n<li><code class=\"language-text\">defer</code> 속성으로 HTML 파싱 완료 후 JS 실행 → 성능 향상</li>\n<li>CSS는 <code class=\"language-text\">&lt;head></code> 안에 배치해야 <strong>FOUT(Flash of Unstyled Text)</strong> 방지</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h3>8. 폼(Form) 요소의 올바른 사용</h3>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"html\"><pre class=\"language-html\"><code class=\"language-html\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;</span>form</span> <span class=\"token attr-name\">action</span><span class=\"token attr-value\"><span class=\"token punctuation attr-equals\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span>/submit<span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span></span> <span class=\"token attr-name\">method</span><span class=\"token attr-value\"><span class=\"token punctuation attr-equals\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span>post<span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span>\n  <span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;</span>label</span> <span class=\"token attr-name\">for</span><span class=\"token attr-value\"><span class=\"token punctuation attr-equals\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span>username<span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span>아이디<span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;/</span>label</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span>\n  <span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;</span>input</span> <span class=\"token attr-name\">type</span><span class=\"token attr-value\"><span class=\"token punctuation attr-equals\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span>text<span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span></span> <span class=\"token attr-name\">id</span><span class=\"token attr-value\"><span class=\"token punctuation attr-equals\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span>username<span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span></span> <span class=\"token attr-name\">name</span><span class=\"token attr-value\"><span class=\"token punctuation attr-equals\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span>username<span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span></span> <span class=\"token attr-name\">required</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;/</span>form</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span></code></pre></div>\n<ul>\n<li><code class=\"language-text\">label</code>은 <code class=\"language-text\">for</code> 속성을 통해 입력요소와 연결</li>\n<li><code class=\"language-text\">required</code>, <code class=\"language-text\">placeholder</code>, <code class=\"language-text\">aria-describedby</code> 등으로 사용자 편의성 강화</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2>3️⃣ 고급(전문가) 수준 웹표준 사항</h2>\n<h3>1. SEO(Search Engine Optimization)와의 연계</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><code class=\"language-text\">&lt;h1></code>은 문서 당 1개만 사용</li>\n<li>구조적 마크업(<code class=\"language-text\">&lt;article></code>, <code class=\"language-text\">&lt;section></code>, <code class=\"language-text\">&lt;header></code>)은 검색봇이 콘텐츠 의미를 이해하는 데 도움</li>\n<li>Open Graph / Twitter Card 메타데이터 추가\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"html\"><pre class=\"language-html\"><code class=\"language-html\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;</span>meta</span> <span class=\"token attr-name\">property</span><span class=\"token attr-value\"><span class=\"token punctuation attr-equals\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span>og:title<span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span></span> <span class=\"token attr-name\">content</span><span class=\"token attr-value\"><span class=\"token punctuation attr-equals\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span>웹표준 가이드<span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;</span>meta</span> <span class=\"token attr-name\">property</span><span class=\"token attr-value\"><span class=\"token punctuation attr-equals\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span>og:description<span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span></span> <span class=\"token attr-name\">content</span><span class=\"token attr-value\"><span class=\"token punctuation attr-equals\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span>HTML5 기반의 웹표준 가이드라인<span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;</span>meta</span> <span class=\"token attr-name\">property</span><span class=\"token attr-value\"><span class=\"token punctuation attr-equals\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span>og:image<span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span></span> <span class=\"token attr-name\">content</span><span class=\"token attr-value\"><span class=\"token punctuation attr-equals\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span>https://example.com/thumbnail.png<span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span></code></pre></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h3>2. 퍼포먼스(성능) 친화적 HTML</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>이미지에 <code class=\"language-text\">loading=\"lazy\"</code> 적용</li>\n<li>불필요한 inline-style, inline-script 제거</li>\n<li><code class=\"language-text\">&lt;script></code>는 body 끝 또는 <code class=\"language-text\">defer</code>로 지연 실행</li>\n<li><code class=\"language-text\">&lt;link rel=\"preconnect\"></code>, <code class=\"language-text\">&lt;link rel=\"dns-prefetch\"></code>로 리소스 사전 연결</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h3>3. 국제화(i18n) 및 언어 속성</h3>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"html\"><pre class=\"language-html\"><code class=\"language-html\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;</span>html</span> <span class=\"token attr-name\">lang</span><span class=\"token attr-value\"><span class=\"token punctuation attr-equals\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span>ko<span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;</span>meta</span> <span class=\"token attr-name\">charset</span><span class=\"token attr-value\"><span class=\"token punctuation attr-equals\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span>UTF-8<span class=\"token punctuation\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span></code></pre></div>\n<ul>\n<li>다국어 페이지는 <code class=\"language-text\">&lt;html lang=\"en\"></code>, <code class=\"language-text\">&lt;html lang=\"ja\"></code> 등으로 명확히 구분</li>\n<li>날짜, 화폐 등은 <code class=\"language-text\">&lt;time></code>, <code class=\"language-text\">&lt;data></code> 태그를 활용</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h3>4. 보안 및 프라이버시 고려</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><code class=\"language-text\">rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"</code> : 외부 링크 클릭 시 보안 위험 방지</li>\n<li><code class=\"language-text\">form</code>에 <code class=\"language-text\">autocomplete=\"off\"</code> 지정으로 개인정보 노출 방지</li>\n<li>HTTPS 프로토콜 사용 및 CSP(Content Security Policy) 적용</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2>4️⃣ 웹표준 검사 도구 및 자동화 팁</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>목적</th>\n<th>도구명</th>\n<th>설명</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>HTML 문법 검사</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://validator.w3.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">W3C Validator</a></td>\n<td>HTML, XHTML 문법 오류 검사</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>접근성 검사</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://wave.webaim.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">WAVE</a></td>\n<td>시각적 접근성 분석</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SEO 점검</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://developers.google.com/web/tools/lighthouse\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Google Lighthouse</a></td>\n<td>SEO/성능/접근성 자동 점검</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>브라우저 호환성</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://caniuse.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Can I Use</a></td>\n<td>HTML/CSS/JS 기능별 지원 현황 조회</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<blockquote>\n<p>✅ <strong>Tip:</strong> CI/CD 파이프라인에 W3C Validator CLI나 Lighthouse CI를 추가하면<br>\n배포 전 자동으로 웹표준 준수 여부를 검사할 수 있습니다.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2>5️⃣ 정리 및 결론</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>웹표준은 **“디자인의 제약”이 아닌 “품질의 기준”**입니다.</li>\n<li>HTML 문법을 정확히 지키면,\n<ul>\n<li>접근성이 향상되고</li>\n<li>SEO 점수가 오르며</li>\n<li>유지보수가 쉬워집니다.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>개발 초기부터 표준을 지키면, <strong>장기적으로 개발 비용이 줄어듭니다.</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2>📚 참고 자료</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>W3C HTML5 Specification: <a href=\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://html.spec.whatwg.org/</a></li>\n<li>WebAIM Accessibility: <a href=\"https://webaim.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://webaim.org/</a></li>\n<li>MDN HTML Reference: <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/ko/docs/Web/HTML\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://developer.mozilla.org/ko/docs/Web/HTML</a></li>\n<li>KWCAG 2.2 (한국형 웹 콘텐츠 접근성 지침): <a href=\"https://www.wah.or.kr/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.wah.or.kr/</a></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<blockquote>\n<p>✍️ 작성자 의견<br>\n본 가이드는 초보 개발자부터 전문가까지<br>\n“HTML의 본질적 가치”를 다시 돌아보게 하기 위한 정리입니다.<br>\n코드 품질은 결국 <strong>표준을 얼마나 존중하느냐</strong>에 달려 있습니다.</p>\n</blockquote>","excerpt":"HTML에서 지켜야 할 웹표준 사항 총정리 **웹표준(Web Standards)**은 웹 개발자가 반드시 알아야 할 기본 중의 기본입니다. HTML 문법을 정확히 지키는 것은 단순히 ‘규칙 준수’가 아니라, 접근성(Accessibility), 검색엔진최적화(SEO), 유지보수성, 호환성 모두를 지키는 핵심입니다. 1️⃣ 웹표준(Web Standards…","fields":{"slug":"/html-web-standards-guide/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"HTML에서 지켜야 할 웹표준 사항 총정리","summary":"표준의 표준에 대하여","date":"2025.11.07.","isoDate":"2025-11-07","updatedAt":null,"categories":["web"],"thumbnail":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/png;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/8a143a609c5f1f4406bac89fd7a4b312/4d776/Standards.png","srcSet":"/static/8a143a609c5f1f4406bac89fd7a4b312/4a410/Standards.png 384w,\n/static/8a143a609c5f1f4406bac89fd7a4b312/f5189/Standards.png 768w,\n/static/8a143a609c5f1f4406bac89fd7a4b312/4d776/Standards.png 1536w","sizes":"(min-width: 1536px) 1536px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/8a143a609c5f1f4406bac89fd7a4b312/b642b/Standards.webp 384w,\n/static/8a143a609c5f1f4406bac89fd7a4b312/c9564/Standards.webp 768w,\n/static/8a143a609c5f1f4406bac89fd7a4b312/18b4b/Standards.webp 1536w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 1536px) 1536px, 100vw"}]},"width":1536,"height":1024}},"publicURL":"/static/8a143a609c5f1f4406bac89fd7a4b312/Standards.png"}}}}]},"related":{"edges":[{"node":{"id":"0c2ffe67-09d7-5778-b67d-63058132d107","fields":{"slug":"/2026-web-trends/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"2026년 웹 트렌드 총정리","summary":"차세대의 선택","date":"2025.10.14.","categories":["ETC","web"],"thumbnail":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/png;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/994b5ecd3436de1d233a149eba9fd888/473b7/web2026.png","srcSet":"/static/994b5ecd3436de1d233a149eba9fd888/be4d9/web2026.png 192w,\n/static/994b5ecd3436de1d233a149eba9fd888/5fc50/web2026.png 384w,\n/static/994b5ecd3436de1d233a149eba9fd888/473b7/web2026.png 768w,\n/static/994b5ecd3436de1d233a149eba9fd888/13e83/web2026.png 1536w","sizes":"(min-width: 768px) 768px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/994b5ecd3436de1d233a149eba9fd888/b3234/web2026.webp 192w,\n/static/994b5ecd3436de1d233a149eba9fd888/65a7c/web2026.webp 384w,\n/static/994b5ecd3436de1d233a149eba9fd888/30053/web2026.webp 768w,\n/static/994b5ecd3436de1d233a149eba9fd888/87027/web2026.webp 1536w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 768px) 768px, 100vw"}]},"width":768,"height":400}}}}}},{"node":{"id":"0cb37623-3e86-5399-a23b-624079488e56","fields":{"slug":"/JavaScript_ES5_Advanced/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"JavaScript ES5 고급 문법, 스킬, 아키텍처 총정리","summary":"JavaScript 이해","date":"2025.09.12.","categories":["Web"],"thumbnail":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/png;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/9b3de103b8bdefc93d45aaec2b0a71a4/473b7/jsRead.png","srcSet":"/static/9b3de103b8bdefc93d45aaec2b0a71a4/be4d9/jsRead.png 192w,\n/static/9b3de103b8bdefc93d45aaec2b0a71a4/5fc50/jsRead.png 384w,\n/static/9b3de103b8bdefc93d45aaec2b0a71a4/473b7/jsRead.png 768w,\n/static/9b3de103b8bdefc93d45aaec2b0a71a4/13e83/jsRead.png 1536w","sizes":"(min-width: 768px) 768px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/9b3de103b8bdefc93d45aaec2b0a71a4/b3234/jsRead.webp 192w,\n/static/9b3de103b8bdefc93d45aaec2b0a71a4/65a7c/jsRead.webp 384w,\n/static/9b3de103b8bdefc93d45aaec2b0a71a4/30053/jsRead.webp 768w,\n/static/9b3de103b8bdefc93d45aaec2b0a71a4/87027/jsRead.webp 1536w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 768px) 768px, 100vw"}]},"width":768,"height":400}}}}}},{"node":{"id":"9dae6708-1a77-5414-976a-c7d57e9e7463","fields":{"slug":"/es5_array_object_guide/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"JavaScript ES5 배열 & 객체 메서드 총정리","summary":"객체와 배열","date":"2025.09.30.","categories":["Web"],"thumbnail":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/png;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/4348ce0bc549902ae7fac96b96b30e9a/473b7/jsAry.png","srcSet":"/static/4348ce0bc549902ae7fac96b96b30e9a/be4d9/jsAry.png 192w,\n/static/4348ce0bc549902ae7fac96b96b30e9a/5fc50/jsAry.png 384w,\n/static/4348ce0bc549902ae7fac96b96b30e9a/473b7/jsAry.png 768w,\n/static/4348ce0bc549902ae7fac96b96b30e9a/13e83/jsAry.png 1536w","sizes":"(min-width: 768px) 768px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/4348ce0bc549902ae7fac96b96b30e9a/b3234/jsAry.webp 192w,\n/static/4348ce0bc549902ae7fac96b96b30e9a/65a7c/jsAry.webp 384w,\n/static/4348ce0bc549902ae7fac96b96b30e9a/30053/jsAry.webp 768w,\n/static/4348ce0bc549902ae7fac96b96b30e9a/87027/jsAry.webp 1536w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 768px) 768px, 100vw"}]},"width":768,"height":400}}}}}},{"node":{"id":"776e2c9c-eeaa-5a61-9428-daf0808b30f3","fields":{"slug":"/javascript-error-handling/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"자바스크립트에서 `try...catch`와 예외 처리 기법 총정리","summary":"예외 처리하는 방안","date":"2025.09.19.","categories":["Web"],"thumbnail":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/png;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/e6ed6d791d1923bf8a7c60b711848b10/473b7/jsError.png","srcSet":"/static/e6ed6d791d1923bf8a7c60b711848b10/be4d9/jsError.png 192w,\n/static/e6ed6d791d1923bf8a7c60b711848b10/5fc50/jsError.png 384w,\n/static/e6ed6d791d1923bf8a7c60b711848b10/473b7/jsError.png 768w,\n/static/e6ed6d791d1923bf8a7c60b711848b10/13e83/jsError.png 1536w","sizes":"(min-width: 768px) 768px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/e6ed6d791d1923bf8a7c60b711848b10/b3234/jsError.webp 192w,\n/static/e6ed6d791d1923bf8a7c60b711848b10/65a7c/jsError.webp 384w,\n/static/e6ed6d791d1923bf8a7c60b711848b10/30053/jsError.webp 768w,\n/static/e6ed6d791d1923bf8a7c60b711848b10/87027/jsError.webp 1536w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 768px) 768px, 100vw"}]},"width":768,"height":400}}}}}}]},"siteStats":{"available":true,"posts":[{"path":"/navigation-api-spa-routing-guide/","views":4},{"path":"/compute-pressure-api-guide/","views":2},{"path":"/gatsby/","views":2},{"path":"/popover-api-and-top-layer-guide/","views":2},{"path":"/cloud-tech-overview/","views":1},{"path":"/frontend-observability-opentelemetry-rum/","views":1},{"path":"/islands-architecture-astro-guide/","views":1},{"path":"/supabase_guide/","views":1},{"path":"/vercel/","views":1},{"path":"/view-transitions-api-guide/","views":1},{"path":"/web-audio-api-guide/","views":1},{"path":"/web-bluetooth-and-hid-api-guide/","views":1},{"path":"/web-bluetooth-api-guide/","views":1},{"path":"/web-identity-credential-manager-api-guide/","views":1},{"path":"/web-locks-api-concurrency-control/","views":1},{"path":"/webcodecs-api-guide/","views":1}]}},"pageContext":{"slug":"/html-web-standards-guide/","relatedSlugs":["/2026-web-trends/","/es5_array_object_guide/","/javascript-error-handling/","/JavaScript_ES5_Advanced/"]}},"staticQueryHashes":["766300711"],"slicesMap":{}}